{"Title":"An Act relative to pipeline siting","BillNumber":"S2165","DocketNumber":"SD1701","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MRP0","Name":"Marc R. Pacheco","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MRP0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T19:31:36.683"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MRP0","Name":"Marc R. Pacheco","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MRP0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T19:31:36.6833333"},{"Id":"MMD1","Name":"Michelle M. DuBois","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MMD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-30T10:49:15.4733333"},{"Id":"CAD1","Name":"Carol A. Doherty","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CAD1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-27T12:34:40.06"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2165/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Pacheco, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2165) of Marc R. Pacheco and Michelle M. DuBois for legislation relative to pipeline siting.  Telecommunications, Utilities and Energy.","DocumentText":"\tSection 94A of chapter 164 of the General Laws is amended by inserting, at the end thereof, the following paragraph:-\r\n\tThe department shall not approve any pipeline capacity contract or gas storage contract where new capacity is proposed to be created through the installation of gas infrastructure in land that, at the time the contract is submitted to the department for approval, is protected under Article 97 of the Articles of Amendments to the Constitution of the Commonwealth. Subsequent siting approvals of gas infrastructure in such constitutionally protected land shall void departmental approval of related pipeline capacity or gas storage contracts.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J37","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J37"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}